<title>
Exhaust Pipe and Muffler Removal and Installation
</title>
<ptxt>
For replacement of exhaust pipe and muffler, refer to 
<intxref refid = "AENLJA0A1B16001">Exhaust System Components:K12M</intxref>
 and the following points.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Use new seal ring.
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Install mounting No.2 (1) positioning its cavity (2) longitudinally.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGJA0A1B1003.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "71.193mm" ver = "01" gw = "216" gh = "185"/>
